  "releaseActivation": false,
  "notes": {
    "authority": "Not a live item generator or combat policy; derived from hidden Equipment/Crafting 2.0 and 13-affix Combat 2.0 prototype. No player items are transformed.",
    "scope": "New authenticated Equipment 2.0 instances and new-rule encounters only; V33/1.0.x and ongoing dungeons retain old rules.",
    "values": "Review-only proposed percentages or percentage points by unit; separately authored basic attacks and post-mitigation HP-damage reflection are additional semantics, never a generic Attack or outgoing Damage multiplier.",
    "caps": "Equipment-affix-only maximums must permit every valid legal combination; class/skills/sets/gems and temporary effects use separate aggregate ceilings. Reflection and special retaliations share a hard output budget; never silently change stored rolls.",
    "deterministic": "Server-pinned approved version and immutable exact-item rolls only; no client RNG or auto-migration of ambiguous old affixes.",
    "traits": "28 authored possibilities: nine Tank, nine Damage, nine Support and Worldwalker utility. Only two combat traits may be active per build; others remain dormant. All mechanics are unimplemented review candidates."
  },
